menu "JapaneseTinyAgentLM"

config JTALM_GATE_PPM
    int "Confidence gate threshold (x 1/1000000)"
    range 0 1000000
    default 836730
    help
        An output whose minimum token probability (unconstrained, as in
        jtalm.model.decode) is below this threshold becomes "[]", as the
        "gate" mode of jtalm.model.evaluate. 0 turns the gate off.
        It can be changed at run time with "!gate <threshold>".

endmenu
